#: doubleyoupi-refined-admin-dashboard.php:57
msgid ""
"You are already running the full Double Youpï suite, and it includes Double "
"Youpï Refined Admin Dashboard. This standalone copy stepped aside to stay "
"out of its way. Want to run it on its own? Deactivate the suite first."
msgstr ""
"Ya estás usando la suite completa Double Youpï, que incluye Double Youpï "
"Refined Admin Dashboard. Por eso esta versión independiente se ha hecho a un "
"lado para no estorbar. ¿Prefieres usarla sola? Desactiva primero la suite."

